      "Explains file upload, download, records, project folders, and metadata operations with dxpy.",
      "Shows job launching, monitoring, output linking, and multi-step workflow patterns.",
      "Provides Python SDK examples for handlers, direct API calls, error handling, and workspace context.",
      "Covers dependency packaging through execDepends, assets, Docker, instance types, and timeouts."
